    <h2>Salt Lake City Weather Impact on Mailboxes</h2>
    <p>Salt Lake City’s climate can be tough on mailboxes, influencing how often they need repairs. We experience <strong>cold, snowy winters and hot, dry summers</strong>, each bringing challenges:</p>
